			"url": "https://github.com/vercel/next.js/discussions/27953",
			"summary": "A maintainer's RFC proposes lifting the rule that global CSS may only be imported in `pages/_app.js`, so pages and `node_modules` packages like react-spectrum can import plain CSS now that webpack 5 tracks entry-point relationships, while noting CSS module imports from packages are unlikely.",
